Package: aethone-tunnel-helper
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AETHONE Project <aethone@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: policykit-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/CHAKCAAD/AETHONE
Description: privileged tunnel helper for the AETHONE Flatpak
 The TUN bring-up half of AETHONE's tunnel mode: pkexec-launched, serves
 exactly one client over a user-owned Unix socket, hands the verified TUN
 fd back to the app and tears everything down on disconnect.
 .
 This companion package exists for the FLATPAK build of AETHONE, where
 the sandbox cannot self-install the helper: install it on the host once
 and the Flatpak's tunnel mode works with the normal polkit prompt. The
 deb/rpm/AppImage/tar releases ship the helper inside the app bundle and
 do NOT need this package.
